ired IPv4 hardening outcomes are satisfied. Direct observations show the settings active on every current interface and retained after reboot. The provider-wide restart protocol is also complete: a healthy pre-restart state was captured, the restart was acknowledged, the boot identity changed from be303eb3-eeb6-4466-86f1-fd6406dd7dad to 57b0c328-24ba-484b-a13f-7e8fa27b8bea, and system, network, sysctl service, and policy state recovered. Fixed lifecycle observations independently corroborate the boot transition and healthy node state.","limitations":["No packet-injection behavioral test was captured; verification relies on direct kernel sysctl values, which are authoritative for these acceptance controls.","The single-node task has no separate application data or cluster state to validate during the restart protocol."]}
